==============================================================================
PART H -- how much does the Aut-ORBIT refinement actually save? (honest measurement)
==============================================================================
  n  classes  |cls|*C(n,2)  sum #Aut-orbits   saving  rigid classes
  4        4            24               16    33.3% 2/       4
  5       12           120               88    26.7% 7/      12
  6       56           840              704    16.2% 41/      56
  7      456          9576             8912     6.9% 399/     456

READING: the Aut-orbit refinement is REAL but SMALL, because most tournaments are rigid.
The dominant saving is the class-BFS itself, not the orbit trick.
